<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Weapons (Recoil Control)</Major>
    <Description>Jitter Aim Pro - Strong is a high-performance aiming profile designed for players seeking improved target tracking and weapon control.

Features:
• Enhanced micro-adjustments
• Smooth target tracking
• Optimized recoil stabilization
• Adjustable strength settings
• Low-latency response
• Compatible with most mouse and keyboard setups
• screen resolution 1920x1080 Full screen

Recommended for players who prefer aggressive gameplay and close to mid-range engagements.

Version: v1.0
Release Status: Stable</Description>
    <Comment>Built for competitive Blood Strike gameplay.

This profile focuses on delivering smooth aiming performance, consistent tracking, and reliable recoil control while remaining fully customizable for individual preferences.

Please test and adjust settings based on your DPI, sensitivity, and hardware configuration.

---- NOTE -----
IF SCREEN  SHAKES TO MUCH TURN UP THE DELAY!


Thank you for using Jitter Aim Pro.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR -6 8
Delay 3 ms
MoveR 6 -8
Delay 3 ms
MoveR 6 8
Delay 3 ms
MoveR -6 -8
Delay 3 ms
MoveR -8 10
Delay 2 ms
MoveR 8 -10
Delay 2 ms
MoveR 8 10
Delay 2 ms
MoveR -8 -10
Delay 2 ms
Goto 2</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blood Strike</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>